-- title:
--   Step-16 certified residue list, chunk 12 (2400 residues modulo $2^{26}$)
-- statement:
--   The explicit `List ℕ` of the 2400 residues $r$ with $0 \le r < 2^{26} = 67108864$ that form chunk 12 of 32 of the modulus-$2^{26}$ step-16 refinement of the [fifteen-mod-16 branch](https://prove2.me/theorems/1184f116-9bfe-49df-bda5-041ca8c276cb). Each residue $r$ in this list replays fifteen exact rows $3 b_i + 1 = 2^{a_i} b_{i+1}$ and closes with a trungated terminal row inside the budget $S_{15} + e \le 26$ whose quatient lands below $r$ itself, so $T^{16}(r) < r$; the list is the certified set among the lifts of the previous residual's surviving classes, computed rather than quoted.
-- source:
